{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingDropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SamplingDropReport","text":"SamplingDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker samples each record after its enrichers and before the consent, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped record is never held, written to a store or delivered. Records a store recovered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"aren’t sampled again."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a drop joins the waiting report of the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the reports waiting unread are at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"most one per event type, however many events are dropped. Copies of a tracker share one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence, which ends once the tracker has finished and every report has been read. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","type":"reference"},{"text":" tracker’s is empty.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV19samplingDropReports11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVyAA08SamplingD6ReportVGvp","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L391"},"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"title":"samplingDropReports","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingDropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"SamplingDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker’s "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s dropped, in the order the drops happen."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"},"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/noOp":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that drops every event, logging each one at debug level. Its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"empty."}],"title":"noOp","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/noop","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"noOp"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","text":"Tracker"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/SamplingDropReport":{"title":"SamplingDropReport","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SamplingDropReport"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/samplingdropreport","abstract":[{"text":"Events a tracker’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler"},{"text":"s left out: the event’s name, how many were left out and when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"they were tracked.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SamplingDropReport","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SamplingDropReport"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Trackers","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker app code tracks events with, and what it applies to each event before it is delivered: enrichers, samplers and consent."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","url":"\/documentation\/trackers","type":"topic"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker","abstract":[{"text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Tracker","type":"topic"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/samplingDropReports":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samplingDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SamplingDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","title":"samplingDropReports","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A report of each event the tracker’s ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler"},{"text":"s dropped, in the order the drops happen.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncQueue"}],"title":"AsyncQueue","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncQueue"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Elements in the order they are enqueued, kept until they are read; one reader at a time reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them."}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Sampler","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a delivery to read."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"records"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tracker"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV7RecordsV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Records"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"records","type":"topic"}}}